# Design system — Hero UI Native template

Canonical visual and composition rules for this Expo + HeroUI Native starter. On reclone, change tokens in `global.css` and identity in `src/constants/app-config.ts` — keep shared primitives unchanged.

## Design principles

1. **Monochrome luxury** — Black/white accent inverts between light and dark. No random brand colors outside `global.css`.
2. **Layered surfaces** — Screen canvas is `bg-background`. Content sits on `bg-surface` via `SurfaceCard`, not flat gray fills.
3. **Restrained depth** — Light mode: `shadow-elevated` on cards and header controls. Dark mode: flat (token-driven via `--surface-shadow`).
4. **Icon-first tabs** — `PremiumTabBar` shows Lucide icons only (no visible text labels).
5. **Semibold hierarchy** — Headings use `font-semibold`. Supporting copy uses `text-caption`.
6. **Compact CTAs** — Inline triggers use `PremiumCtaButton` or `Button size="sm"`, not default `md`.

## Theme tokens (`global.css`)

### Colors (semantic classes)

| Token | Class | Role |
|-------|-------|------|
| `background` | `bg-background` | Screen canvas |
| `surface` | `bg-surface` | Cards, icon circles, controls |
| `foreground` | `text-foreground` | Primary text |
| `muted` | `text-muted` | Secondary text, icons |
| `accent` | `bg-accent` | Chips, focused tab icons |
| `overlay-dim` | `bg-overlay-dim` | Dialog dim layer |
| `backdrop` | `bg-backdrop` | Modal fallback |

Cards use **default surface only** — see `.cursor/rules/default-surfaces-only.mdc`.

### Typography utilities

| Class | Use for |
|-------|---------|
| `text-page-title` | Screen header title, page hero |
| `text-section-title` | Section headings (`SectionTitle` component) |
| `text-emphasis` | Price, highlight lines |
| `text-caption` | Supporting copy, meta rows |
| `text-cta-label` | Primary button labels |

### Spacing utilities

| Class | Value | Use for |
|-------|-------|---------|
| `px-screen-x` | 16px | Screen horizontal padding |
| `pt-screen-top` | 16px | Content top padding |
| `pb-screen-bottom` | 32px | Scroll content bottom |
| `gap-section` | 16px | Between major screen blocks |
| `gap-section-title` | 8px | Section title wrapper |
| `p-card` | 16px | Card internal padding |
| `p-card-lg` | 24px | Large card padding |
| `min-h-touch` / `min-w-touch` | 44px | Minimum touch targets |

### Surface utilities

| Class | Use for |
|-------|---------|
| `rounded-card` | All cards (`SurfaceCard`) |
| `rounded-control` | Header avatar, theme toggle circles |
| `shadow-elevated` | Light-mode elevation on surfaces |
| `input-flat` | Borderless form inputs |

