## Screen composition recipe

```tsx
<ScreenShell title="Screen name">
  <View className="gap-1">
    <Text className="text-page-title">Page hero</Text>
    <Text className="text-caption">Subtitle</Text>
  </View>

  <View className="gap-section-title">
    <SectionTitle>Section</SectionTitle>
    <SurfaceCard className="gap-2 p-card">
      {/* grouped content */}
    </SurfaceCard>
  </View>
</ScreenShell>
```

- List screens: `ScreenShell scrollable={false}` + `FlashList`; bottom padding uses `--tab-bar-clearance`.
- Do not co-locate components inside `src/app/`.

## Dialog pattern

```tsx
<Dialog.Portal>
  <DialogBlurOverlay />
  <Dialog.Content>
    <Dialog.Close variant="ghost" />
    {/* content */}
  </Dialog.Content>
</Dialog.Portal>
```

Reference: `src/components/examples/example-dialog.tsx`.

## Tabs

Wire `PremiumTabBar` in `src/app/(tabs)/_layout.tsx`. When adding a tab, update `TAB_ICONS` in `premium-tab-bar.tsx`.

## Anti-patterns

- No hex/rgb colors in components — use semantic tokens only.
- No `Button` default `md` for inline/dialog triggers.
- No stock Expo tab bar with text labels.
- No `Dialog.Overlay` without `DialogBlurOverlay`.
- No `surface-secondary` / `surface-tertiary` on cards (see `default-surfaces-only.mdc`).
- No heavy borders — use surfaces and `shadow-elevated` instead.
- Do not call `Uniwind.setTheme` outside theme context.

## Customization on reclone

| What | Where |
|------|--------|
| Colors, type scale, spacing | `global.css` |
| App name, storage keys, avatar | `src/constants/app-config.ts` |
| Slug, scheme, icons | `app.json` + `assets/images/` |
| Tab icons | `src/components/premium-tab-bar.tsx` |

## Pre-ship checklist

- [ ] Screen uses `ScreenShell` (or `scrollable={false}` for `FlashList`)
- [ ] Grouped blocks use `SurfaceCard` with `p-card` where appropriate
- [ ] Headings use typography utilities or `SectionTitle`
- [ ] Inline CTAs use `PremiumCtaButton` or `Button size="sm"`
- [ ] New dialogs include `DialogBlurOverlay`
- [ ] New tabs update `TAB_ICONS` and `(tabs)/_layout.tsx`
- [ ] No hardcoded hex colors in components
